Package: mscos-panel
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: mescon <mescon@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/mescon/mscOS
Depends: mscos-core (>= @VERSION@), python3 (>= 3.11), python3-aiohttp, python3-websockets, python3-numpy
Description: mscOS control panel
 The web panel (a PWA, in Swedish and English) for an mscOS streamer: what plays and
 in which format, the signal path and its verification, sources (Spotify, Roon,
 HQPlayer NAA) and modules for amplifiers and home automation. Players are downloaded
 on the device from their publishers; no keys or player binaries are included.
